[2J[H=== PATTERN MATCHING DEMO ===

Loading REGEX.LIB via LOAD LIBRARY...
Loaded library: REGEX v1.0 [OPEN] (0 SUB, 3 FUNCTION, 1 DEF FN)
  Compiled: 4 symbols, 74 instructions (94 lines)

Glob-style patterns:
  *     = match any characters
  ?     = match single character
  [abc] = match character class
  [!ab] = match negated class

Examples:
  GLOB_MATCH(
  GLOB_MATCH(
  GLOB_MATCH(
  GLOB_MATCH(

This engine can be extended into a full
regex with +, (), |, and quantifiers.
