  CALL ADV_EXIT(0, 
  CALL ADV_EXIT(1, 
  CALL ADV_ITEM(0, 
  CALL ADV_START(0)

Player commands:
  N S E W   - move
  LOOK      - describe room
  TAKE item - pick up
  DROP item - put down
  INVENTORY - show carried items

Extend: locked doors, NPCs, puzzles.
